flowchart TB
classDef plain fill:#ffffff,stroke:#222222,stroke-width:2px,color:#111111
P["PoE adds two prompts' scores:<br/>a cat x a dog gives a hybrid"]:::plain
S["Cause 1: the sampler<br/>summed scores are not the<br/>product's score at noisy steps"]:::plain
M["Cause 2: the model<br/>the exact product is not<br/>co-occurrence without support"]:::plain
I["ICLR result: the right correction<br/>added early, steps 0 to 10,<br/>turns the hybrid into two"]:::plain
C["Paper 2: supply that correction<br/>with SDXL frozen, from a classifier<br/>trained afterwards"]:::plain
T{"Does it lift PoE, the joint<br/>prompt and CO3, not CO3 alone?"}:::plain
Y["a method: benchmark rows<br/>against ToMe, FKC, CO3"]:::plain
N["a patch or a null: says which<br/>cause the correction misses"]:::plain
P --> S
P --> M
S --> I
M --> I
I --> C --> T
T -- yes --> Y
T -- no --> N
